        "section_index": null,
        "text": "An elliptical shaft with a hazel tree. A 23m deep, 15m diameter shaft leads to a boulder slope at the base of which is a small hole and the second pitch of 18m. A boulder floor slopes down to a possible dig. \"Upstream\" quickly chokes."
      },
      {
        "index": 1,
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "section_index": null,
        "text": "Marked 596 with orange tape."
      }
    ],
